OL,3,GNEWSAFormer ministers lose out in Isle
OL,4,Aof Man general election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Chief Minister Alfred Cannan has
OL,7,Fkept his seat, although three former
OL,8,Fministers have lost their seats in the
OL,9,F2026 Isle of Man general election.
OL,11,FFormer health minister Lawrie Hooper,
OL,12,Fformer infrastructure minister Michelle
OL,13,FHaywood and former education minister
OL,14,FJulie Edge have all lost their seats.
OL,16,FTwo new members have been elected in
OL,17,FRamsey, with former commissioners Juan
OL,18,FMcGuinness and Robert Cowell both being
OL,19,Felected.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
