OL,3,GNEWSAFormer ministers lose out in Isle
OL,4,Aof Man general election
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Middle, Deputy Chief Minister Jane
OL,7,FPoole-Wilson topped the poll followed
OL,8,Fby James Cochrane.
